{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-luk-5-1","title":"Luke 5:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ teaches the people out of Peter's ship; 4 in a miraculous taking of fishes, shows how he will make him and his partners fishers of men; 12 cleanses the leper; 16 prays in the wilderness; 17 heals one sick of the palsy; 27 calls Matthew the Publican; 29 eats with sinners, as being the physician of souls; 33 foretells the fastings and afflictions of the apostles after his ascension; 36 and illustrates the matter by the parable of old bottles and worn garments.</p>\n<p>it. 8:45; 12:1; Mt 4:18-22; 11:12; Mr 1:16-20; 3:9; 5:24 the lake. Nu 34:11 Chinnereth. Jos 12:3 Chinneroth. Mt 14:34; Mr 6:53</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-2","title":"Luke 5:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>washing. Mt 4:21; Mr 1:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-3","title":"Luke 5:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>which. Mt 4:18; Joh 1:41,42 he sat. Mt 13:1,2; Mr 4:1,2; Joh 8:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-4","title":"Luke 5:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Launch. Mt 17:27; Joh 21:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-5","title":"Luke 5:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>we. Ps 127:1,2; Eze 37:11,12; Joh 21:3 nevertheless. 6:46-48; 2Ki 5:10-14; Eze 37:4-7; Joh 2:5; 15:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-6","title":"Luke 5:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>they inclosed. 2Ki 4:3-7; Ec 11:6; Joh 21:6-11; Ac 2:41; 4:4; 1Co 15:58; Ga 6:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-7","title":"Luke 5:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>that they should. Ex 23:5; Pr 18:24; Ac 11:25; Ro 16:2-4; Ga 6:2; Php 4:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-8","title":"Luke 5:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>he. Mt 2:11; Joh 11:32; Ac 10:25,26; Re 1:17; 22:8,9 Depart. Ex 20:19; Jud 13:22; 1Sa 6:20; 2Sa 6:9; 1Ki 17:18; 1Co 13:12 Da 10:16,17; Mt 17:6 I am. Job 40:4; 42:5,6; Isa 6:5; Mt 8:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-9","title":"Luke 5:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>he. 4:32,36; Ps 8:6,8; Mr 9:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-10","title":"Luke 5:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>James. 6:14; Mt 4:21; 20:20 partners. 7; 2Co 8:23 from. Eze 47:9,10; Mt 4:19; 13:47; Mr 1:17; Ac 2:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-11","title":"Luke 5:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>they forsook. 18:28-30; Mt 4:20; 10:37; 19:27; Mr 1:18-25; 10:21,29,30; Php 3:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-12","title":"Luke 5:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>a man. Mt 8:2-4; Mr 1:40-45 full. 17:12; Ex 4:6; Le 13:1-14:57; Nu 12:10-12; De 24:8; 2Ki 5:1,27; 7:3 2Ch 26:19,20; Mt 26:6 fell. 17:16; Le 9:24; Jos 5:14; 1Ki 18:39; 1Ch 21:16 besought. 17:13; Ps 50:15; 91:15; Mr 5:23 if. Ge 18:14; Mt 8:8,9; 9:28; Mr 9:22-24; Heb 7:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-13","title":"Luke 5:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>I will. Ge 1:3,9; Ps 33:9; 2Ki 5:10,14; Eze 36:25-27,29; Ho 14:4 Mt 9:29,30 immediately. 4:39; 8:54,55; Joh 4:50-53</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-14","title":"Luke 5:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>he charged. Mt 8:4; 9:30; 12:16 and shew. 17:14; Le 13:2 and offer. Le 14:4,10,21,22 for. 9:5; Mt 10:18; Mr 1:44; 6:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-15","title":"Luke 5:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>so. Pr 15:33; 1Ti 5:25 went. Mt 4:23-25; 9:26; Mr 1:28,45 great. 12:1; 14:25; Mt 4:25; 15:30,31; Mr 2:1,2; 3:7; Joh 6:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-16","title":"Luke 5:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>6:12; Mt 14:23; Mr 1:35,36; 6:46; Joh 6:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-17","title":"Luke 5:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>that there. 21,30; 7:30; 11:52-54; 15:2; Joh 3:21 Jerusalem. Mt 15:1; Mr 3:22; 7:1 power. 6:19; 8:46; Mt 11:5; Mr 16:18; Ac 4:30; 19:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-18","title":"Luke 5:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Mt 9:2-8; Mr 2:3-12; Joh 5:5,6; Ac 9:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-19","title":"Luke 5:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>they went. Mr 2:4 housetop. De 22:8; 2Sa 11:2; Jer 19:13; Mt 10:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-20","title":"Luke 5:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>he saw. Ge 22:12; Joh 2:25; Ac 11:23; 14:9; Jas 2:18 Man. 7:48; Ps 90:7,8; 107:17,18; Isa 38:17; Mt 9:2; Mr 2:5; Joh 5:14 2Co 2:10; Col 3:13; Jas 5:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-21","title":"Luke 5:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>scribes. 17; 7:49; Mr 2:6,7 blasphemies. Le 24:16; 1Ki 21:10-14; Mt 9:3; 26:65; Joh 10:33; Ac 6:11-13 Who can. Ex 34:6,7; Ps 32:5; 35:5; 103:3; 130:4; Isa 1:18; 43:25; 44:22 Da 9:9,19; Mic 7:19; Ro 8:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-22","title":"Luke 5:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>perceived. 1Ch 28:9; Ps 139:2; Pr 15:26; Isa 66:18; Eze 38:10; Mt 9:4; 12:25 Heb 4:12; Re 2:23 What. 24:38; Mr 8:17; Ac 5:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-23","title":"Luke 5:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Mt 9:5; Mr 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-24","title":"Luke 5:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>that the. Da 7:13; Mt 16:13; 25:31; 26:64; Joh 3:13; 5:27; Re 1:13 power. Isa 53:11; Mt 9:6; 28:18; Joh 5:8,12,22,23; 17:2; 20:22,23; Ac 5:31 I say. 13; 7:14; 8:54; Joh 11:43; Ac 3:6-8; 9:34,40; 14:10 and take. Joh 5:8-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-25","title":"Luke 5:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>immediately. 13; Ge 1:3; Ps 33:9 glorifying. 13:13; 17:15-18; 18:43; Ps 50:23; 103:1-3; 107:20-22; Joh 9:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-26","title":"Luke 5:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>and they. 7:16; Mt 9:8; 12:23; Mr 2:12; Ac 4:21; Ga 1:24 and were. 8; 8:37; Jer 33:9; Ho 3:5; Mt 28:8; Ac 5:11-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-27","title":"Luke 5:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>and saw. Mt 9:9-13; 10:3 Matthew. Mr 2:13,14; 3:18 Follow me. 18:22; Mt 4:19-21; 8:22; 16:24; Joh 1:43; 12:26; 21:19-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-28","title":"Luke 5:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>11; 9:59-62; 1Ki 19:19-21; Mt 19:22-27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-29","title":"Luke 5:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>made. Joh 12:2 and there. Mt 9:10; Mr 2:15; 1Co 5:9-11; 10:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-30","title":"Luke 5:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>17,21; 7:29,30,34,39; 15:1,2; 18:11; 19:7; Isa 65:5; Mt 21:28-32 Mr 7:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-31","title":"Luke 5:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>They that. Jer 8:22; Mt 9:12,13; Mr 2:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-32","title":"Luke 5:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>4:18,19; 15:7,10; 18:10-14; 19:10; 24:47; Isa 55:6,7; 57:15; Mt 18:11 Mr 15:7,10; Ac 2:38; 3:19,26; 5:31; 17:30; 20:21; 26:18-20 1Co 6:9-11; 1Ti 1:15,16; 2Ti 2:25,26; 2Pe 3:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-33","title":"Luke 5:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>Why. 18:12; Isa 58:3-6; Zec 7:6; Mt 9:14-17; Mr 2:18-22 and make. 11:1; 20:47; Pr 28:9; Isa 1:15; Mt 6:5,6; 23:14; Mr 12:40; Ac 9:11 Ro 10:2,3 but. 7:34,35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-34","title":"Luke 5:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>the children. Jud 14:10,11; Ps 45:14; So 2:6,7; 3:10,11; 5:8; 6:1; Mt 25:1-10 Re 19:7-9 bridegroom. Ps 45:10-16; Isa 54:5; 62:5; Zep 3:17; Mt 22:2; Joh 3:29; 2Co 11:2 Eph 5:25-27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-35","title":"Luke 5:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>when. 24:17-21; Da 9:26; Zec 13:7; Joh 12:8; 13:33; 14:3,4; 16:4-7,16-22 Joh 16:28; 17:11-13; Ac 1:9; 3:21 and. Isa 22:12; Mt 6:17,18; Ac 13:2,3; 14:23; 1Co 7:5; 2Co 11:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-36","title":"Luke 5:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>No man. Mt 9:16,17; Mr 2:21,22 agreeth. Le 19:19; De 22:11; 2Co 6:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-37","title":"Luke 5:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>old. Jos 9:4,13; Ps 119:83</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-38","title":"Luke 5:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>Eze 36:26; 2Co 5:17; Ga 2:4,12-14; 4:9-11; 5:1-6; 6:13,14; Php 3:5-7 Col 2:19-23; 1Ti 4:8; Heb 8:8-13; 13:9,10; Re 21:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-5-39","title":"Luke 5:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>Jer 6:16; Mr 7:7-13; Ro 4:11,12; Heb 11:1,2,39</p>"}]}